er/\">View Product &amp; Styles <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></article><article class=\"ec-library-card boom-scene-card\" hidden=\"\" data-model=\"TYCB-001\" data-scene-group=\"cups\" data-search=\"tycb-001 custom outdoor stadium cup series pp · 2 oz / 10 oz / 12 oz / 16 oz / 17 oz / 20 oz / 22 oz / 24 oz\"><a class=\"ec-library-image-link\" href=\"/products/16-oz-stadium-cup-smooth/\"><img alt=\"Custom Outdoor Stadium Cup Series — TYCB-001\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/v88-20261023/tycb-001-0f3e3b707b.webp\" width=\"600\"/></a><div class=\"ec-library-card-copy\"><p class=\"ec-library-model\">TYCB-001</p><h3><a href=\"/products/16-oz-stadium-cup-smooth/\">Custom Outdoor Stadium Cup Series</a></h3><p class=\"ec-library-facts\">PP · 2 oz / 10 oz / 12 oz / 16 oz / 17 oz / 20 oz / 22 oz / 24 oz</p><p class=\"boom-scene-role\">Camp drinkware and bottle opening</p><a class=\"ec-library-link\" href=\"/products/16-oz-stadium-cup-smooth/\">View Product &amp; Styles <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></article></div><p class=\"boom-scene-empty\" hidden=\"\">No matching products. Try another model, material or product type.</p><button class=\"boom-scene-more\" type=\"button\">Show More Products</button><div class=\"boom-scene-quote\"><div><h3>Bring Your Event Range Together</h3><p>Send your model shortlist, quantity and artwork for free design and product mockups.</p></div><a href=\"mailto:niles@boomdrinkware.com\">Email Your Event Brief</a></div></section><section class=\"bx-section bx-tinted\"><div class=\"bx-wrap\"><div class=\"bx-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"bx-kicker\">HOW IT WORKS</p><h2>From requirements to an approved order.</h2></div></div><div class=\"bx-step-grid\"><article class=\"bx-step\"><span>01</span><h3>Define the brief</h3><p>Share use, quantity, artwork and destination.</p></article><article class=\"bx-step\"><span>02</span><h3>Agree the proposal</h3><p>Review model, configuration, cost and schedule.</p></article><article class=\"bx-step\"><span>03</span><h3>Approve the sample</h3><p>Identify the approved artwork and sample version.</p></article><article class=\"bx-step\"><span>04</span><h3>Produce & deliver</h3><p>Agree inspection, packing and delivery requirements.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"bx-section\"><div class=\"bx-wrap bx-qa\"><div class=\"bx-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"bx-kicker\">BUYER QUESTIONS</p><h2>Clear answers before the next step.</h2></div></div><details><summary>Can I enquire before choosing a model?</summary><p>Yes. Describe the intended use, quantity and arrival date; add a reference or drawing if available.</p></details><details><summary>What determines MOQ and lead time?</summary><p>The model, materials, design versions, decoration, packaging and tooling affect the proposal. Small batches from 10 pieces and fast sampling apply to eligible projects; confirm the conditions in your quote.</p></details><details><summary>What should my enquiry include?</summary><p>A model or product idea, quantity, artwork, pack contents, destination and required arrival date are a useful start.</p></details></div></section><div class=\"bx-wrap\"><section class=\"bx-brief-strip\"><div><p class=\"bx-kicker\">YOUR NEXT STEP</p><h2>Let’s make your project specific.</h2><p>Share the model or idea, quantity, artwork, destination and arrival date. You can add files in the project enquiry.</p></div><a class=\"bx-button\" href=\"/contact/?models=Custom%20Camping%20%26%20Outdoor%20Drinkware\">Request a Project Quote ↗</a></section></div><section class=\"bx-wrap bx-section\"><div class=\"bx-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"bx-kicker\">START WITH THE BUYING TASK</p><h2>Packed size, components and cleaning</h2></div></div><div class=\"bx-two\"><article class=\"bx-panel\"><h3>What matters for this project</h3><p>For collapsible models, define target capacity and both folded and open dimensions.</p><ul><li>Drink or recipient and the intended service setting</li><li>Quantity per design and exact contents of a set</li><li>Required arrival date and delivery destination</li></ul></article><article class=\"bx-panel dark\"><h3>Turn the idea into a reviewable brief</h3><p>Start with a model reference. Then align artwork, sample approval and packing with the project’s deadline.</p><ul><li>Identify artwork versions and approval owner</li><li>Review the sample against actual use</li><li>Separate personal gifts from shared service items</li></ul></article></div></section></div>"},"/zh/camping-drinkware/":{"title":"定制露营杯具｜折叠杯、硅胶杯与免费设计","description":"对比现有折叠杯、硅胶杯及紧凑塑料杯型，为露营活动定制图案。我们提供免费设计方案、产品效果图及具体型号报价。","html":"<div class=\"bx-site\"><section class=\"bx-business-hero\"><div class=\"bx-wrap bx-business-grid\"><div><nav class=\"bx-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a class=\"bx-textlink\" href=\"/zh/\">首页</a> / 露营与户外杯具定制</nav><p class=\"bx-kicker\">应用场景 / 采购规划</p><h1>定制露营杯与折叠杯</h1><p class=\"bx-lead\">围绕收纳空间、饮用用途及使用方式开发户外品牌系列。</p><div class=\"bx-actions\"><a class=\"bx-button\" href=\"/zh/contact/?models=Custom%20Camping%20%26%20Outdoor%20Drinkware\">提交项目询价 ↗</a><a class=\"bx-button bx-button-secondary\" href=\"/zh/products/\">浏览产品型号</a></div></div><figure class=\"bx-business-photo\"><img src=\"/occ-camping.webp?v=2f98fdbbaf5b\" alt=\"露营与户外杯具定制 — 视觉参考\" width=\"900\" height=\"600\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><figcaption>规划概念图 · 非实际客户订单或工厂实拍。</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"bx-wrap bx-section\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"bx-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"bx-kicker\">先看一组相关参考</p><h2>值得比较的型号参考。</h2></div><p>以下为选型建议，不代表已完成客户项目，下单前需核对具体型号。</p></div><div class=\"bx-model-grid\"><article class=\"ec-library-card\" data-model=\"GJZD-009\"><a class=\"ec-library-image-link\" href=\"/zh/products/collapsible-mug/\"><img src=\"/img/v88-20261023/gjzd-009-ef2d900c27.webp\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"折叠马克杯(Mug)\"></a><p class=\"buyer-image-note\">型号 / 图稿参考 · 最终配置按样品